      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like im constantly dragging everyone down with me. like my partner and my kids, they're so good and happy, and then there's just me... always sad, always struggling. it feels like im just a black hole sucking the life out of them. they'd be so much better off if they didn't have to worry about me anymore.",
